  title: 'Safety in Singapore (Present Day) '
  info: "Singapore is one of the safest cities in the world, with low crime rates
    and strict law enforcement. The government enforces strict penalties for crimes,
    including heavy fines, caning, and capital punishment for serious offenses. Public
    spaces are well-monitored with CCTV cameras, ensuring security. The country\u2019s
    clean streets, efficient emergency services, and strong community policing contribute
    to a sense of safety. Despite its urban density, Singapore\u2019s safety measures
    make it a secure place for residents and tourists alike.  "
